  "bodyHash": "2d240b614fdf12c2",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Better Beacon Placement 是一個極簡且可設定的模組，允許玩家手持礦物方塊右鍵點擊信標，即可輕鬆放置信標底座。潛行（蹲下）+右鍵點擊可放置手中整個堆疊的礦物方塊。破壞信標時，也會同時破壞所有底座方塊，並將它們掉落於信標所在位置。被替換的方塊會掉落在信標頂部。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><em>基岩不會被替換。</em><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>您可能也會對 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-conduit-placement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Conduit Placement</a></span> 感興趣。</strong></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>breakBeaconBaseBlocks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，當信標本身被破壞時，會掉落所有信標底座方塊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dropReplacedBlockTopBeacon</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，當礦物方塊替換普通方塊時，該方塊會掉落於信標頂部。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您可以手持礦物方塊右鍵點擊信標，它將放置在下一個底座位置：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/better-beacon-placement/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"844\" height=\"424\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您也可以潛行（蹲下）+右鍵點擊來放置一整組礦物方塊：</strong><br></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/better-beacon-placement/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"840\" height=\"424\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您可透過設定開啟「將替換下的方塊掉落於信標頂部」功能：</strong><br></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/better-beacon-placement/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"844\" height=\"426\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>破壞信標方塊的同時也會破壞所有底座方塊：</strong><br></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/better-beacon-placement/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您便可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">評論功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤評論。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a> 提出。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
